    <briefdescription>
<para>A single field-level change between two project states. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput>field_path</computeroutput> follows JSON Pointer syntax (RFC 6901), e.g. <computeroutput>&quot;/metadata/title&quot;</computeroutput>. For top-level document additions/removals the path is the document key (e.g. <computeroutput>&quot;/doc:&lt;uuid&gt;&quot;</computeroutput>). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
